  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.1 fix(sonar): pass CancellationToken and fix new-code issues (#1938)\n        v1.3.0 feat(velopack,cloudsync): scheduled update check, deferral store and forced update (#1681)\n        v1.2.0 feat(velopack,cloudsync): update apply gate, so an update waits for running syncs (#1679, #1680)\n        v1.1.0 feat(velopack): pure update policy with deferral and action unions (#1678)\n        v1.0.1 refactor(logging): replace interpolated free-text log messages with dedicated templates (#1372)\n        v1.0.0 fix(logging)!: log exception type names only, remove exception-taking templates (#1371)\n        v0.1.1 fix(logging): log exception type names only, never messages or instances (#1371)\n        v0.1.0 feat(velopack-publishing): expose update check outcome",
